      <div class="grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>The problem</h3>
          <p>Most men are not &ldquo;bad.&rdquo; They are at war with themselves. They compromise, hide, manage appearances, and mistake shame for identity.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>The cost</h3>
          <p>A man can look solid and still be coming apart inside. What he refuses to confront will shape his home and the next generation.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>The fight</h3>
          <p>We confront wounds, drag darkness into the light, move from fear to faith, and build disciplined strength anchored in identity.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
